        "id": 68198,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-17T14:56:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"penta\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/6f9a4e/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> penta:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>How is pixel lincoln? Worth the 40 bucks?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I have been thinking that since I came across it about 3 weeks ago. Picking up Boss Monster for 25 bucks was a no brainer and it turned out awesome, but I am just not as sure about this one. Though it might be worth it just to try and pick up the extras while there is still an option to buy them from the website.</p>",
